ood Policy Research Institute, and Centro Internacional de Agricultura Tropical)</collab></person-group><source>Global Rural-Urban Mapping Project (GRUMP)</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>Palisades, NY: CIESIN, Columbia University</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Schuschny</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Gallopin</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>La distribuci&#x000f3;n espacial de la pobreza en relaci&#x000f3;n a los sistemas ambientales en Am&#x000e9;rica Latina</article-title><source>Medio Ambiente y Desarrollo</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>Chile: Comisi&#x000f3;n Econ&#x000f3;mica para Am&#x000e9;rica Latina y el Caribe (CEPAL)</publisher-name><fpage>42</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>You</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Wood</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An entropy approach to spatial disaggregation of agricultural production</article-title><source>Agric Syst  </source><year>2006</year><volume>90</volume><fpage>329</fpage><lpage>347</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.agsy.2006.01.008</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>You</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Wood</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Wood-Sichra</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Generating plausible crop distribution maps for Sub-Saharan Africa using a spatially disaggregated data fusion and optimization approach</article-title><source>Agric Syst</source><year>2009</year><volume>99</volume><fpage>126</fpage><lpage>140</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.agsy.2